{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_8","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"submission\":\"update.json\",\"summary\":\"Raised the configuration-endpoint question to a witnessed violation bound to experiment fcb238abc7cd45cdb8b0c03f847b8ad2-experiment (CheckRun 39131804298e4de2bfb8bbb0ccfaf00b, events 13-14): with a committed LogConfiguration at index 6 and a live configuration already containing the added nonvoter, GetConfiguration().Index() reported 0 and Stats reported latest_configuration_index \\\"0\\\"; recorded that as a behavior entry with observability-only limits. Queued a repair-path probe for the parent configuration question (does a later configuration entry restore a restarted node's empty configuration) to bound how long the gap can persist. Also built and locally verified, but did not yet queue, an independent authority-transition probe showing that a removed member's TimeoutNow RPC made a follower become leader while the healthy leader stepped down.\"}"}}
